  "observationBoundary": "One BizHawk 2.11.1 / Genesis Plus GX process retains the accepted five-case direct PickMithrilWeapon probe, then three distinct direct post-confirmation @PlaceOrder cases, then three direct accepted-recipient fulfillment cases. Each fulfillment case writes only the source-derived BlacksmithAction_FulfillOrder frame locals and jumps to the original @AddItem block. It observes AddItem first-ITEM_NOTHING insertion, source-selected order word read and clear, fulfilledOrdersNumber increment, and IsWeaponOrRingEquippable carry. At the original equippability RTS, the observer verifies the normal @AddItem continuation at the top of the original stack, rewrites only that word to its generated continuation, and lets the original RTS execute; it does not execute the following branch, equip prompt, or BlacksmithMenu presentation. The observer snapshots and restores only CURRENT_GOLD's longword, RANDOM_SEED's word, the four MITHRIL_WEAPONS_ON_ORDER words, the one GAME_FLAGS byte owning flag 80, and the three selected 56-byte combatant records. Probe code, synthetic action frame, stack, and other work RAM are excluded from the restoration claim.",
